<title>UK: Deutsche sets call, put warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets call, put warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets (Deutschland) has issued a total of 50 million American-style call and put warrants, in five equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 19.FEB.97-18.DEC.97   PAYDATE	19.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DUES		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  $791.45 (FOREX 1.6780 DEM/USD)</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT     STRIKE	ISSUE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	$800	  1.0 DEM    8.61 PCT     13.28 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	$820	  0.84 DEM   9.93 PCT	0.84 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT C	$780	  0.65 DEM   6.34 PCT     20.43 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT D	$800	  0.80 DEM   4.94 PCT     16.60 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT E	$820	  1.02 DEM   4.07 PCT     13.02 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
